  "description": "A quick heads up...",
  "body_html": "<p>Very quick note today, cutting a position today. We keep losses small, and double down on our winners. Several winning stocks we have “<a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">DCA up</a>” on. But this stock has largely been a dud. This is a courtesy heads up that<strong> I am cutting TXT, Textron (its the -9.25% stock).</strong></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TB6V!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F65af8e98-1a33-4a48-b76e-eead114cb6d2_429x219.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TB6V!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F65af8e98-1a33-4a48-b76e-eead114cb6d2_429x219.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TB6V!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F65af8e98-1a33-4a48-b76e-eead114cb6d2_429x219.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TB6V!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F65af8e98-1a33-4a48-b76e-eead114cb6d2_429x219.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TB6V!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F65af8e98-1a33-4a48-b76e-eead114cb6d2_429x219.png\" width=\"429\" height=\"219\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/65af8e98-1a33-4a48-b76e-eead114cb6d2_429x219.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:219,&quot;width&quot;:429,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:22931,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/200154986?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F65af8e98-1a33-4a48-b76e-eead114cb6d2_429x219.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TB6V!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F65af8e98-1a33-4a48-b76e-eead114cb6d2_429x219.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TB6V!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F65af8e98-1a33-4a48-b76e-eead114cb6d2_429x219.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TB6V!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F65af8e98-1a33-4a48-b76e-eead114cb6d2_429x219.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TB6V!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F65af8e98-1a33-4a48-b76e-eead114cb6d2_429x219.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Dollar cost average UP on your winners, cut your losers. Ignore the top stock, I have written articles on why I am holding the incredibly volatile solid state battery company. </figcaption></figure></div><p>Rest of the market, and our positions, look fine for now. When there is an update worth an update, I will let you know! Thanks for stopping by. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>",
